TEXT 64 832 Left 2 !.include LMG1210_modes.lib
TEXT 64 864 Left 2 !.include EPC2361.lib
TEXT 64 896 Left 2 !.param FSW=100k DUTY=0.9 DEAD=50n TR=2n TS=20u T=1/FSW
TEXT 64 928 Left 2 !.model DBOOT D(Is=1n N=1.2 Rs=1 Cjo=2p Tt=1n Bv=150 Ibv=10u)
TEXT 64 960 Left 2 !.tran 0 {TSTOP} 0 5n
TEXT 2264 -16 Left 2 ;H GATE: ON output->gate / OFF gate->output
TEXT 2824 -16 Left 2 ;L GATE: ON output->gate / OFF gate->output
TEXT 64 1040 Left 2 !.param RGON=6 RGOFF=6 LGATE=10n LPOWER=2n LCAP=0.5n
TEXT 64 1072 Left 2 !.model DGATE D(Is=1u N=1.05 Rs=0.05 Cjo=5p Tt=0 Bv=30)
TEXT 64 -128 Left 3 ;LMG1210 + EPC2361: gate/power parasitics and separate ON/OFF paths
TEXT 64 -80 Left 2 ;Variable FSW and DUTY; low-side first for bootstrap. Edit parameters below.
TEXT 64 -32 Left 2 ;Illustrative inductances only. LGATE per gate loop; LPOWER total interconnect; LCAP additional capacitor ESL.
TEXT 64 16 Left 2 ;Ideal Kelvin source returns; common-source inductance and magnetic coupling are not modeled.
TEXT 2408 -56 Left 2 ;Power commutation inductance = LPOWER + LCAP = 4.5 nH default.
TEXT 64 1152 Left 2 !.param TSTOP=5m
TEXT 64 1200 Left 2 ;DUTY = requested high-side fraction before dead-time subtraction (0 < DUTY < 1).
TEXT 64 1232 Left 2 ;Require min(DUTY,1-DUTY)/FSW > DEAD+TR. Bootstrap requires low-side charging time.
TEXT 64 1264 Left 2 ;No preset plots or automatic measurements. Click Run and select your own nodes/components.
